Marco, normally out from 14:00 to 22:00, is home for the gathering. His phone, which is usually at the coffee table in the evening, will be in use or ON_PERSON. Yuki's guitar may be set aside on the couch (she is hosting, not practicing). The dog food bag stays in the pantry (the dog is fed before guests arrive).

