# p_6a1e — Marco's Weekday: Entry Dwell, Kitchen Midday, Gone by Two

The resident sightings trace Marco's weekday precisely: he is in the entry area from 00:00 through 08:00 (five separate looks, all finding him there—likely sleeping in or near the entry space, consistent with a late-shift worker who goes to bed around 23:00 and rises around 07:00). At 08:00 he is still in the entry while Yuki is in the living room. By 10:00 he has moved to the kitchen, where he stays with Yuki through 12:00. He is gone by 14:00 (only Yuki is in the kitchen at 14:00, 16:00, 18:00, 20:00).

His items confirm this: the lunchbox is in the cupboard four out of four times in 9-17h (it does NOT go out with him, contradicting p_b7c2 and p_8c2d). Vitamins are at the counter three out of four times in 9-17h. The journal is at the nightstand two out of four times in 9-17h (the other two empty, perhaps he took it to the kitchen). His scarf and umbrella stay at the entry hook and entry floor respectively (confirmed by p_8c2d's held blocks and the 4/4 evidence). His phone is at the coffee table in the evening (1/1 sighted) but absent in 9-17h (0/4), suggesting it is ON_PERSON or in his pocket while he is in the kitchen. His glasses are at the bathroom shelf (sighted 1x at 10:00).

What would refute this: finding the lunchbox out of the house during 14-22h, or finding Marco's scarf at OUT_OF_HOUSE during his work shift.

